# Static-asset headers (adapter-cloudflare copies this next to the assets; the Worker's own
# responses set theirs in code). SvelteKit's hashed build output never changes under one name;
# fonts, images and the snapshot's logos only change with a new file name; everything else
# revalidates so a deploy never leaves a browser holding new HTML against old JS or CSS.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/_app/immutable/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/brand-tile-media/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/library/logos/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
